#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectreverb.rst:16 9048659d1cf442d8be310575a92d0371
msgid "A reverb effect for adding spatial ambience and simulated acoustic spaces to audio."
msgstr "总线混响效果，参数风格接近 Godot 的 AudioEffectReverb。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectreverb.rst:21 5802c37698484a5fa19d6b465c4c7896
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectreverb.rst:23 73d1ed60b0de4790b3571afd37798007
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectReverb creates the impression of sound being played in a physical space by "
"simulating reflections and decay characteristics of various environments. Use this effect to add "
"depth, warmth, and realism to audio sources."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectReverb**    是用于总线的混响效果，参数风格接近 Godot 的    ``AudioEffectReverb``   "
"。它通过房间尺寸、阻尼、预延迟、扩散和干湿比例塑造空间感，适合给一组声音统一添加环境混响。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectreverb.rst:25 366ce9c4376d4f91a220182617fc27ee
msgid ""
"Adjust the dry/wet mix to control the balance between the original signal and the reverberated "
"signal. Increase room size for cathedral-like spaces, or decrease for small room ambience."
msgstr "通过干湿混合比例调节原始信号与混响信号的平衡。较大的房间尺寸可模拟教堂等空间，较小的值可模拟小房间。"

